You are acting as a Principal Enterprise Software Architect, Post-Quantum Cryptography (PQC) Architect, Cybersecurity Platform Architect, UI/UX Architect, DevSecOps Engineer, and Product Designer.

Your task is to review, redesign, and enhance every module involved in the Quantum Remediation and Migration workflow within the QGuard Helix Platform.

The objective is to ensure that every page works together as a single, end-to-end Post-Quantum Migration Platform that guides customers from asset discovery through remediation, migration, validation, and ultimately Quantum Trust Certification.

